Example 15 : NSA Supportability - NAS Capability 
For NSA, there should be two major feature should be supported. One is lower layer band combination and the other one is higher layer dual connectivity. Higher layer dual connectivity (i.e, dual connectivity with NR) is notified by a NAS message with a parameter called DCNR . This feature is configured in UE network capability in Attach Request (in case of LTE) or Registration Request (in case of NR). 
NOTE : This is for NSA Supportability with NAS point of view.

strictEC=0, V2X PC5=0, multipleDRB=0) 

